# Chezmoi copies source files byte for byte, so keep them LF on every
# platform. Without this, Windows' core.autocrlf=true checks the tree out
# as CRLF and deploys CRLF keys and scripts (the CRLF in id_github_personal.pub
# made Git's bundled ssh fail with "error in libcrypto").
* text=auto eol=lf
*.age binary